                "text": "Republicans say cutting Medicaid won\u2019t hurt working people\u2014they\u2019re\u00a0straight up lying.\u00a0\n\nThe CBO says Trump\u2019s plan would kick 5.5 million off coverage, hurting kids, seniors, people with disabilities and more\u2014all to fund billionaire tax cuts. https://t.co/bwdwBErWLh",
